    results.json
      041c6003d80ba166fb9d359c1c42cdf9c49a7a63c8c4c5ebf6b27e0619c4e8d4

(The hashes are rechecked below before return; if they differ, the final
reported hashes supersede this block.)

## 9. Verdict

OPEN AT A NAMED STEP: Uniform connected Hurwitz-orbit gap.

