+# M10 coordinator plan: exact bridge parent-Hamiltonian algebra
+
+## Target
+
+For `E=T_N^2` with product map `p:E->A_N`, let `Pi_i` be uniform
+conditional averaging of `(A_i,A_(i+1))` at fixed ordered product and set
