O(N^2L_N)+O(N log N)+O(N^(3/2)sqrt(L_N)).             (2.24)
```

Summing all non-isolate sizes leaves less than `B_a`.  Hence

```text
|V^(a)|<=N^8B_a.                                      (2.25)
```

The direct outer count also supplies the global orientation.  For isolate
