The coordinator lane has now removed one of the two weighted-tree obstacles. Fleurat’s deletion kernel need not have pointwise lower bounds: its aggregate balance is enough to build randomized canonical paths. For the conditioned-Poisson plane-tree law, the only intermediate density factor is an exact binomial-at-its-mean ratio, bounded polynomially. This yields an auxiliary lazy leaf-replanting chain with a rigorous gap at least order \((r+1)^{-8}\). The remaining—and now isolated—step is routing those replantings through the exact parking leaf rotations with polynomial total load.
