Phi_pm(A_(q,-)^ell)
 >=(N-q)/[3Nm(N-1)^2(m-2)D_N]
 >=1/(24N^7).                                        (2.15)
```

For balance and `q<N/2`, deletion plus all `N-1` leaf attachments gives

```text
Phi_pm(A_(q,-)^b)
 >=1/[3Nm(N-1)(m-2)D_N]
