e gaps through an independently accepted shuttle flow. On the refutation side, for N>=10^12 and m=4N^3+4 every literal disconnected-macro neighborhood through radius floor(m/10^4) has conductance at least N^-25; the smaller m/10^8 theorem has independently passed a fresh referee. At minimal length, every symmetric branch-balance, leaf-count, maximum-degree, joint upper-quadrant, and both mixed-quadrant tree-profile threshold tested so far has a frozen inverse-polynomial conductance theorem under the literal full K; the newest mixed-quadrant claims await fresh review.
