| path | 60 | 7,808 | 1 |
| T | 60 | 8,254 | 1 |

The weighted sum is
`5(8856)+60(7808)+60(8254)=1,008,000`, the exact size of `F_5`; the global
bridge has 1,770,940 words.  The thinnest tested restriction cut is the star
event `rho_e<=2`, with 4,428 of 8,856 states and


