Thus energy scales linearly by `gamma`, and products telescope to
`t(t-1)/[s(s-1)]`.  Summing conditional residual demands costs exactly
`delta(f)Ef max T_t`.

For a quotient electrical flow `theta`, disintegrating one edge in
