## 8. Exact mass of the maximum-degree separator

The new comb--path energy-barrier candidate has an exact stationary-mass
reduction.  If `D>=1`, then

```text
pi_r(max_i d_i>=D)<=(r+1)(e/D)^D.                    (8.1)
