  → Prove or refute uniform intermediate exterior-layer expansion
  → Resolve the minimal-long-cycle cyclic-orbit incidence quotient
  → Construct a polynomial marked root-mean lift / full parking-flow comparison
  • Run three fresh terminal referees only after a frozen Terminal A or B candidate exists
