- **Proved here:** strict `P` descent; reachable mark closure; the infinite
  fixed-power one-step obstructions (3.2)--(3.3); seed identity (5.1); and
  the conditional polynomial implication (4.2) `=>` (4.4).
- **Exact finite falsifiers only:** renewal row sums, inverse-`q` ratios,
  grouped potentials, and seed-kernel scans.
- **Unresolved:** (4.2), polynomial marked occupation, actual unmarked
