  → Resolve or sharply reduce cyclic H0 endpoint-sharing signed two-step cancellation
  → Prove/refute a noncanonical signed-braid bypass on the voltage family
  ✓ Integrate independently accepted M84 zero-row theorem
  • Synthesize durable ledger and decide next terminal-facing branch
