Verdict: PROVED IN THE DENSE-GENUS RANGE; OPEN AT
LOW-AND-INTERMEDIATE-GENUS CURVATURE.

### L-0052 - M05 shuttle comparison frozen for fresh review

M05's final report proves the provisional construction in L-0050 with the
following exact statement.  For every feasible macro-fiber `alpha`, let
`delta` be the minimum of one and the lazy symmetric connected-factorization
Hurwitz gaps of its nontrivial components.  Then

    gap(P_H^alpha) >= delta/m^10,

and the inherited actual-`H_3` comparison gives

    gap(K^alpha)
      >= (m-1) delta/[2|R_m|(m-2)M^2m^10]
      >= 2 delta/(3N^4m^10).

The ideal product chain has gap at least `2delta/m^4`.  Every separated
internal generator is routed by commute--Hurwitz--commute in fewer than
`2m` physical moves.  Metadata `(component,u,v,orientation,stage)` has fewer
than `m^4` possibilities and recovers at most one source for each used
directed edge, giving total comparison congestion at most `2m^6`.

The coordinator checked the product weights, both endpoint transformations,
metadata count, self-loop and duplicate-orientation treatment, directed
capacity, and final constants.  A fresh probability/congestion referee has
received the frozen bundle; promotion remains pending that independent
verdict.

