```

reversibility gives the exact posterior score

```text
f(s)=bar K(s,B_k)/bar pi(B_k)-bar K(s,A_k)/bar pi(A_k),
eta bar K(t)=bar pi(t)(bar K f)(t).                (L-0214.1)
```

The cyclic phase formula in `(L-0214.1)` retains the exceptional orbit size
