e gaps through an independently accepted shuttle flow. On the refutation side, for N>=10^12 and m=4N^3+4 every literal disconnected-macro neighborhood through radius floor(m/10^4) has conductance at least N^-25; the smaller m/10^8 theorem has independently passed a fresh referee. At minimal length, a freshly accepted theorem gives conductance at least 1/(24N^7) for both global placements of every arbitrary subset of labeled join trees; therefore all join-tree-saturated cuts are ruled out as Terminal-B witnesses.
