`37e454eaca9d1e992e87109b9b0f6f731a57b53d7953e62e02f5f0ac29e0f661`.

Verdict: TREE--UNICYCLE--TREE HANDLE-CUT LIFT AND EXACT SPECTRUM PROVED AND
FRESHLY ACCEPTED; PARTIAL-FIBER HANDLE-CYCLE EXPANSION, UNIFORM MARKED
HITTING, `gamma_1`, FULL-`K` MIXING, AND ALL TERMINAL CLAIMS OPEN.

