For every cross-cell directed pair `(x,y)` with cell means `g_k,g_l`,

```text
(g_k-g_l)^2
 <=3[(f(x)-f(y))^2+(f(x)-g_k)^2+(f(y)-g_l)^2].        (6.4)
```

Summing stationary cross flow, the first term is at most `3E_L(f,f)` under
