# M108 plan: direct adjacent-pair bridge gap

Date: 2026-08-12.

## Objective

Attack the exact auxiliary proposition sufficient for Terminal A. For
`T=T_N`, `M=binom(N,2)`, a feasible endpoint `h in S_N`, and

```text
