codex
The exact small cases are already informative on the two new fronts. Marked-leaf deletion has connected polynomial-size fibers through \(d=4\), but literal one-step lifting of every base move fails. Conversely, the word-preserving cut-refresh projection is connected by itself at \(d=3,4\) with gaps near \(0.09\), so the handle projection may admit a cleaner combinatorial proof than expected.
