### L-0222 - Fixed handle-cycle cells have a product law, but one cell is same-size circular

M104 freezes report SHA-256
`a04c67103dd356d00b3c9ac267ba2eb255c69632d06707cb839ed8dd5ebb269b`,
proof SHA-256
