363-
364-- A particular full-chain update choice `(r,i)` has outer selection mass
365-  `1/[2|R_m|(m-r+1)]`; the leading `1/2` is holding.  Conditional outcomes
366-  have mass equal to that selection mass divided by the exact block-fiber
367-  size, summed over choices that produce the same next word.
368-- In a JSTV restriction, every off-fiber outcome contributes holding mass.
