+naively is factorial.  Signed null-pushing puts each fixed marked-leaf fibre
+in a moving-square normal form in `O(d)` physical moves, but the square label
+remains uncontrolled.  The converse statewise deletion lift is false: at
+`d=4`, exactly `10992/29328` requested nontrivial base moves fail to lift in
