Adjacent moves are the exact left-coagulation/right-fragmentation operations,
and the fixed-key cell has the closed weight

```text
|C_kappa|=j!(2d-j)!
 product_(B in Q_L union Q_R)|B|^(c_B-3)
 product_(p-cycle a)[|a|^|a|/(|a|-1)!]^2.          (L-0226.1)
```

Writing `beta(d)` for M104's exact handle-key projection gap, the stationary
measure and edge-flow comparisons have the correct directions

```text
D^-1<=bar_pi/rho<=D,       Q_G>=2D^-2 Q_A,
gap(G)>=2D^-3 gap(A_d),    beta(d)>=D^-3 gap(A_d). (L-0226.2)
```

M113 proves qualitative connectivity of `A_d` for every `d>=2`; it does not
route a congested canonical flow.  At fixed `p`, the colored incidence
forests are bases of the first Higgs lift of the doubled graphic matroid, but
the natural exact Hurwitz-weighted basis polynomial is not Lorentzian already
at `d=4`: an exact derivative Hessian minor has determinant `8294400` and
inertia `(2,2)`; the untilted analogue has determinant `1/82944`.  This
refutes the direct SLC/down-up shortcut only.  A separate balanced split
family has exponentially small individual edges but inverse-polynomial
aggregate outgoing probability, refuting pointwise minimum-edge comparison
without yielding a bottleneck.

M118 independently ACCEPTS with zero material objection.  Its no-import
`d=2,3,4` reconstruction reproduces every key, cell and overlap count, the
three chain gaps, Higgs counts `1,18,378`, both exact Hessian determinants,
and the balanced aggregate arithmetic.  M118 report SHA-256 is
`e780115979cfb3c281007fe62a507cd2062d1d061cd9bd2faa3f6f54a4387b3b`;
its manifest SHA-256 is
`2c1552d1df1af619cad35d86b45a369473c0852e7c9c5721c6b6e8dac0cfaf98`.

Verdict: EXACT HANDLE-PROJECTION REDUCTION, QUALITATIVE CONNECTIVITY, AND
NAMED ROUTE OBSTRUCTIONS PROVED AND FRESHLY ACCEPTED.  THE STANDALONE
`gap(A_d)>=d^-O(1)` LOCAL UNICYCLE INCIDENCE GAP IS OPEN.  `Gamma_0`,
`beta`, `gamma_1`, MARKED HITTING, THE ORIGINAL-CHAIN GAP, AND BOTH TERMINALS
REMAIN OPEN.

### L-0227 - Rooted minimal identity factorizations are exactly UST times a permutation

M112 freezes report SHA-256
`6364b8c94d507885d5d408c98ba49c9405623e93a5c3bcd043a3c1404f0bf4f3`,
proof SHA-256
`dc2c87c2c28deb5438301fb95254040012fc69115bf9c7f547542382ebd82f0a`,
DPS implementation/results SHA-256
`b5e193ba0595aaf61d497a3482685b5a5d8c63faaf9f8567931db31629357add` /
`4467ba62dddd4ac3dc351d634d797c4bec011504556867f0f7dc6493d28e4b87`.
For the uniform connected minimal identity sector

```text
Z_d={w: length(w)=2d-2, eval(w)=id, support(w) connected},
```

the exact marked-leaf deletion count is a transfer-matrix recurrence.  For a
downstairs `z in Z_(d-1)` and null interval `[a,b)`, support joins transport
the missing predecessor by a permutation matrix and cycle cuts use an
identity matrix with one all-ones `2x2` block.  Hence

```text
L_(a,b)(z)=1^T T_a...T_(b-1)1,
(d-1) binom(2d-2,2)<=L(z)<=(d-1)^2 binom(2d-2,2). (L-0227.1)
```

This gives only polynomial one-level Radon--Nikodym distortion; iterating it
naively is factorial.  Signed null-pushing puts each fixed marked-leaf fibre
in a moving-square normal form in `O(d)` physical moves, but the square label
remains uncontrolled.  The converse statewise deletion lift is false: at
`d=4`, exactly `10992/29328` requested nontrivial base moves fail to lift in
one physical step.

The primary-source DPS Proposition 1, Proposition 3, Theorems 4 and 5 give a
literal bijection before forgetting the white root,

```text
rooted Z_d <--> Cayley trees on [d] x S_(2d-2),       (L-0227.2)
```

and forgetting the root is exactly `d`-to-one.  Thus uniform rooted `Z_d` is
exactly `UST(K_d)` times an independent uniform permutation.  A half-lazy
UST basis-exchange coordinate has gap at least
`1/[2(d-1)(binom(d,2)-d+1)]`, while the half-lazy random adjacent-value
permutation coordinate has exact gap
`[1-cos(pi/(2d-2))]/(2d-3)=Theta(d^-3)`.  Their equal mixture is therefore
an explicit inverse-polynomial ideal chain.

DPS supplies no physical locality.  Both one-step intertwinings are already
false at `d=3`; at `d=4`, adjacent-value ideal edges and UST exchange edges
can have physical signed-Hurwitz distances eight and twelve.  Those finite
distances and finite lexicographic loads are not asymptotic congestion
bounds.  The exact nonrecursive obligation is therefore ROOTED PRODUCT LOCAL
COMPARISON: simulate every ideal edge by a distribution of physical signed
Hurwitz paths of polynomial length and stationary congestion, including the
exact root quotient.

M119 independently ACCEPTS with zero material objection.  Its no-import
audit reconstructs the transfer recurrence, deletion equivariance, the
statewise refutation, DPS `2/3/4`-to-one coverage at `d=2,3,4`, both distance
histograms/maxima, aggregate finite flows, and the ideal-chain
normalizations.  Its primary-source audit confirms exactly the cited DPS
scope.  M119 report SHA-256 is
`3c183dc7707b57a8283eacb474123e7b212a7e6efa6f910389fd9be0272ba4e7`;
manifest SHA-256 is
`fa052231905fbc6376004ec0cfad3abe0faeeece0d08b8d313e98d24f12778f3`.

Verdict: EXACT ROOTED PRODUCT LAW, IDEAL GAP, MARKED-TRANSFER REDUCTION, AND
NAMED ONE-STEP REFUTATIONS PROVED AND FRESHLY ACCEPTED.  THE PHYSICAL
MINIMAL-IDENTITY GAP IS OPEN AT ROOTED PRODUCT LOCAL COMPARISON.  M104'S
ARBITRARY-PRODUCT `Gamma_0` SECTORS, GENUS-ONE GAP, ORIGINAL-CHAIN GAP, AND
BOTH TERMINALS REMAIN OPEN.

