f(g)=E[a(t_1)+a(t_2)|t_1t_2=g],
f_i=f(t_(2i-1)t_(2i)),
F=sum_(i=1)^l f_i.
```

Put

```text
V=E|f_1|^2,
C=Re E[conj(f_1)f_2],
kappa=C/V.
```

The central two-position law makes `V,C` independent of the selected
positions. M67 proves

```text
C=48/n+o(n^-1),
