kappa>=(24/d_0)n^(-1/2)+o(n^-1/2),                  (1.1)
```

where `d_0=11.2404385426...`. In particular `C>0` eventually. The nontrivial
cyclic character centers `F`, and exactly

```text
||F||^2=lV+l(l-1)C=lV[1+(l-1)kappa].                (1.2)
```

